    "projectNameAr": "فندق ماريوت كورت يارد",
    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\">The project includes building Marriott Courtyard Hotel on the southern entrance to the Diplomatic Quarter of Riyadh. The property comprises 286 rooms, a health club, business center and ballrooms.</span></p>\r\n",
